---
source: src/repl/dispatch/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Usage: [INVOCATION_OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...

- Commands -------------
  exit        Exit application.
  help        Show this command overview.
  last        Replay the last result (--raw before pipes).
  source      Run commands from files.
  plugins     Inspect and manage plugin providers
  doctor      Run diagnostics checks
  theme       Inspect and apply themes
  config      Inspect and edit runtime config
  alias       Create and manage command aliases
  history     Inspect or prune REPL history
  context     Inspect or clear remembered session values

Pipe command output with |; use | H for in-band DSL help.

- Common Invocation Options
  -v, --verbose     Increase message verbosity
  -q, --quiet       Decrease message verbosity
  -d, --debug       Increase developer log verbosity
